  "Name": "Beetel Connection Manager NetConfig.ini Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack-based buffer overflow in Beetel Connection Manager. The vulnerability exists in the parsing of the UserName parameter in the NetConfig.ini file. The module has been tested successfully against version PCW_BTLINDV1.0.0B04 on Windows XP SP3 and Windows 7 SP1.",
